        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dane DeHaan, Derek Cianfrance, Anton Corbijn, Gore Verbinski, Luc Besson\n- Products: In Treatment, Chronicle, The Place Beyond the Pines, Kill Your Darlings, The Amazing Spider-Man 2, Life, A Cure for Wellness, Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets\n- Roles: Jesse, Andrew Detmer, Jason Kancam, Lucien Carr, Harry Osborn, James Dean, Lockhart\n- Topics: film and television roles, genre\n\nFacts:\n- Dane DeHaan played Jesse on the HBO series In Treatment.\n- In 2012, Dane DeHaan played Andrew Detmer in Chronicle.\n- In 2012, Dane DeHaan played Jason Kancam in Derek Cianfrance's The Place Beyond the Pines.\n- In 2013, Dane DeHaan played Lucien Carr in Kill Your Darlings.\n- In 2014, Dane DeHaan played Harry Osborn in The Amazing Spider-Man 2.\n- In 2015, Dane DeHaan played James Dean in Anton Corbijn's Life.\n- A Cure for Wellness is a 2016 science fiction psychological horror film.\n- In 2016, Dane DeHaan played Lockhart in Gore Verbinski's A Cure for Wellness.\n- In 2017, Dane DeHaan played the title character in Luc Besson's Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets.",
